      "writtenOn": "2019-01-31T19:13:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One more thing. Avoid usage of \"DSDS\". It is wrong:\n - it does not scale well for devices with 3 SIM cards\n - it does not accurately reflect status for DSDA devices (dual SIM dual active)",
      "parentUuid": "615a46c2_e7dc687a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1468,
