      "writtenOn": "2019-02-01T18:33:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it should not a DSDS specific structure, i change it to phone status and include both sim status and phone_count and enabled_modem_count. \n\nIn DSDS event, we care about the phone_count, inserted_sim_count, enabled_modem_count. We can get the data from the phoneStatus. \n\nFor the metrics you are interested, I think you could add the SimStatus to SMS, Call session.",
      "parentUuid": "05dd2758_c4906dfb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1468,
        "startChar": 10,
